Reviewed-by: Dmitry Baryshkov <dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com>
Tested-by: Neil Armstrong <neil.armstrong@linaro.org> # on T14s OLED
Signed-off-by: Daniel Lezcano <daniel.lezcano@oss.qualcomm.com>
